'''Vermilion Forest''' (Japanese: '''クチバの森''' ''Kuchiba Forest'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive [[forest]] in the [[Kanto]] [[region]]. It is located outside [[Vermilion City]].

{{Ash}} and [[Goh]] first visited Vermilion Forest in ''[[JN006|Working My Way Back to Mew!]]'', when Goh was keen to catch more Pokémon and fill the [[Pokédex]]. Whilst there, Ash and Goh encountered a variety of Wild Pokémon with Goh managing to successfully capture all of Kanto's {{t|Bug}}-types.

Ash and Goh visited Vermilion Forest once more in ''[[JN033|Trade, Borrow, and Steal!]]'', where they hoped to find a {{p|Pinsir}} that Goh could [[trade]] to [[Kricketina Kylie]] in exchange for her {{p|Heracross}}. After an encounter with {{TRT}}, Goh was able to catch a Pinsir that he later traded for Heracross.
